      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "COLD OPEN",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "But at day twenty-one, the tumor in the 150-nanometer arm shrank only fifteen percent. The arm that got fewer particles — the 30-nanometer arm — shrank seventy-two percent. More drug in the tumor. Less kill.",
