    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "THE MECHANISM",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "But total mass measured on the whole organ is not what kills cells. The tumor is not a uniform bucket. It is a three-dimensional landscape with an edge and a core — and cells live throughout.",
