      "act": "THE IMPLICATION",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "The worst-case tumor cells are in the core. They have been under oxygen starvation for months, which selects for cells that survive stress and resist treatment. These are the cells most likely to drive recurrence — and they are exactly where the 150-nanometer drug never went.",
